20:32.560 --> 20:32.980
The pullback.

20:32.980 --> 20:33.460
Yes.

20:33.680 --> 20:39.020
It means they are dual manifestations of a single admissibility defect in the universe.

20:39.520 --> 20:42.240
Think of the folded paper with the hole punched in it again.

20:42.740 --> 20:44.920
Let's say the paper is the fabric of space time.

20:45.500 --> 20:47.320
The hole itself is an obstruction.

20:47.580 --> 20:49.160
A place where the rules break down.

20:49.160 --> 20:53.360
If you look at that hole through the coordinate system of space, it looks like local curvature.

20:53.520 --> 20:54.120
It looks like gravity.

20:54.260 --> 20:55.020
Things fall into it.

20:55.220 --> 20:59.080
But if you shift your perspective and look at that exact same hole through the coordinate

20:59.080 --> 21:02.560
system of time, it looks like historical irreversibility.

21:02.820 --> 21:03.660
It looks like entropy.

21:04.060 --> 21:04.200
Wow.

21:04.620 --> 21:09.060
A system that is locally curved must, by definition, be historically irreversible.

21:09.440 --> 21:14.560
