21:14.960 --> 21:16.940
They are the exact same tear in the fabric.

21:16.940 --> 21:23.720
Which gives a totally terrifying new definition to a black hole or a singularity.

21:23.980 --> 21:27.360
Because we usually just say a singularity is where math breaks down or gravity becomes

