But under this framework, a singularity is literally the spot where that comparison map,

21:34.380 --> 21:38.360
the bridge between the immediate present and the accumulated history, shatters.

21:38.540 --> 21:38.940
Exactly.

21:39.420 --> 21:41.680
The comparison map phi fails to resolve.

21:41.680 --> 21:47.580
It's a region where the defect diverges so sharply that no valid physical state can even exist.

21:48.180 --> 21:52.260
Space and time completely untethered from each other because their underlying unifying

21:52.260 --> 21:53.880
geometry has ripped.

21:54.140 --> 21:54.580
Okay.

