Every single time you make a choice, turn left, turn right, click this, download that,

23:25.240 --> 23:27.960
a massive spiel wall slams down behind you.

23:28.300 --> 23:34.020
Your history is physically, actively forcing where you are allowed to go next.

23:34.300 --> 23:35.760
That is a perfect visualization.

23:36.360 --> 23:39.640
The history of the computation becomes a geometric constraint on its future.

23:40.020 --> 23:44.060
You cannot revisit a state that your history has structurally blocked off.

23:44.060 --> 23:50.300
So what happens if a program tries to make a move that looks totally fine locally, like typing the correct password,

